<div n="2"><head>K. <hi rendition="#g">Sach&#x017F;en</hi>.</head><lb/>
<div n="3" type="jComment"><dateline>&#x2AF6; <hi rendition="#b">Dresden,</hi> 7 Aug.</dateline><lb/>
<p>Das O&#x017F;terfe&#x017F;t hat un&#x017F;ere Kam-<lb/>
